{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">《夫妻的博弈》昨晚（26日）播出一集，雪文 Sherman（郭柏妍 飾）與繼威 Mark（張頴康 飾）終於拉埋天窗。正當 Sherman 以為可以迎接幸福人生，點知親生阿媽沈淑冰（黎燕珊 飾）竟然無預警踩場，更在婚禮上展露貪錢本色，搞出一場大龍鳳！</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"1d761f9f-9892-47d0-97b3-13253634ac07.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026jL4kKdsA5B1787811566.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1d761f9f-9892-47d0-97b3-13253634ac07.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">劇情講到 Sherman 因為不想面對親生母親，竟然花錢請來特約演員（沈可欣飾）假扮阿媽出席婚禮！豈料真正的淑冰突然踩場，在眾人面前大爆自己才是真生母。Sherman 見到多年不見、曾經狠心拋棄自己的母親，震驚之餘即時下逐客令，趕對方離開。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">不過淑冰卻「賴死」唔走，更反客為主斥責女兒為何要找人假扮她。積怨多年的 Sherman 瞬間大爆發，流住淚連環咆哮控訴：「你有咩資格做我阿媽？你記唔記得你要嫁去加拿大，就算見到我都唔會認我做女，你記唔記得呀？」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">面對女兒的血淚指控，淑冰竟企圖開脫，聲稱當年因老公有外遇才將情緒發洩在她身上：「就算我幾唔好，都係生你出嚟嗰個！所以我咪搵番你修補關係，你又唔睬我。」Sherman 聽罷更加崩潰激動：「我梗係唔睬你啦！你根本喺度搞破壞，你快啲同我走呀！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"29c49085-6911-4cfa-bbd9-c4e1c24dd761.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026DEmYIsRSN61787811566.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"29c49085-6911-4cfa-bbd9-c4e1c24dd761.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"a2b58ef7-36e6-4a11-85c3-92c260c0c6c2.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026EGy3Fsh7Fe1787811566.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a2b58ef7-36e6-4a11-85c3-92c260c0c6c2.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"0dfc50fb-1721-4584-9063-47142eb0029d.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026JJSQ4RFdzG1787811566.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0dfc50fb-1721-4584-9063-47142eb0029d.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">爭吵到最後，淑冰終於露出貪錢真面目！原來她死闖婚禮的唯一目的就是為了錢：「我點都好，都係生你養你嗰個，你今日出嫁，我係咪好應該要有禮金？」她更擺出一副極度「衰格」的嘴臉企圖勒索，最終被保安強行抬走離場，場面極度肉酸。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">其實早前在《正義女神》中，黎燕珊已經飾演過貪錢又不理家庭的衰阿媽，今次在《夫妻的博弈》再次完美演繹「衰格母親」，為𢱑禮金連面子都不要。精湛演技令網民睇到咬牙切齒，紛紛留言笑指珊姐已成為TVB「御用衰阿媽」，更有觀眾對 Sherman 的「綠茶」行為表示同情：「其實雪文變成咁嘅性格，佢阿媽真係好大主因！」、「珊姐近年成日做呢啲角色，真係好搞笑又入戲！」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T06:42:14.851403+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":757,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}